StopWatch Hub contains components under different licenses. There is no single
repository-wide license.

- MIT-licensed files are covered by LICENSES/MIT.txt.
- PrintSphere-derived files are covered by LICENSES/FNCL-1.1.txt and are
  restricted to non-commercial use unless separately licensed by the
  PrintSphere copyright holder.

See NOTICE.md and the SPDX identifier in each source file for the applicable
license and attribution. A firmware image containing PrintSphere-derived code
is not an entirely MIT-licensed binary.
